/meridian-schoo...</title><content type='html'>http://boiseguardian.com/2009/02/23/meridian-schools-asks-to-continue-tax/&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Being I have no email for you I&#39;m doing it this way. Meridian is holding a secret and special election to jack up property taxes with a ten million bond. The Statesman refuses to print the fact there&#39;s going to be a special election on March third.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8822675477164636185/comments/default/4740163813800979434'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8822675477164636185/comments/default/4740163813800979434'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/set-spin-cycle-to-race-agitate.html?showComment=1235571720000#c4740163813800979434' title=''/><author><name>AvgJoe</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/set-spin-cycle-to-race-agitate.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8822675477164636185' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8822675477164636185' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 25, 2009 at 7:22 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8097314189688143206</id><published>2009-02-24T22:43:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-02-24T22:43:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Let&#39;s face it.  The current occupant of the Oval O...</title><content type='html'>Let&#39;s face it.  The current occupant of the Oval Office has his Sturmabteilung (ACORN).  With law enforcement being increasingly militarized, perhaps Eric Himmler, uh, Holder can head up the American Shutzstaffel, complete with its own Gestapo.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8822675477164636185/comments/default/8097314189688143206'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8822675477164636185/comments/default/8097314189688143206'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/set-spin-cycle-to-race-agitate.html?showComment=1235540580000#c8097314189688143206' title=''/><author><name>Bob</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/16565620274260288512</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='31' height='13' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_DJFdiJYKX2Y/R-VWHCcM2qI/AAAAAAAAATk/Tgw6srrhKx0/S220/TerryToons+02.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/set-spin-cycle-to-race-agitate.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8822675477164636185' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8822675477164636185' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-758129297"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 24, 2009 at 10:43 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1403880096487791924</id><published>2009-02-24T20:41:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-02-24T20:41:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Anonymous, you beat me to it! I&#39;m actually working...</title><content type='html'>Anonymous, you beat me to it! I&#39;m actually working on an essay right now on the subject of armed, assertive citizenship, and it plays off Snyder&#39;s superb 1994 piece.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Shortly after Snyder&#39;s essay was published (it actually earned a grudgingly favorable two-page Newsweek write-up by George F. Will), I interviewed him for a piece in The New American entitled &quot;Bonfire of the Liberties.&quot; &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;My cover story was about the Clinton &quot;assault weapons&quot; ban. The illustration we chose for the cover depicted some grim-faced drudge shoveling perfectly good confiscated firearms into a blast furnace.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Snyder is a very sharp guy. I&#39;m glad you brought up his essay, which is even more timely today.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8822675477164636185/comments/default/1403880096487791924'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8822675477164636185/comments/default/1403880096487791924'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/set-spin-cycle-to-race-agitate.html?showComment=1235533260000#c1403880096487791924' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='22' height='32' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_KgBT8kIRgBo/SJvC4fevJoI/AAAAAAAADAY/kAbZoDrn1qI/s1600-R/Grigg(2).jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/set-spin-cycle-to-race-agitate.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8822675477164636185' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8822675477164636185' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 24, 2009 at 8:41 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3301382660375939524</id><published>2009-02-24T20:25:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-02-24T20:25:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Well, we are a nation of cowards - in the sense th...</title><content type='html'>Well, we are a nation of cowards - in the sense that Jeffery Snyder expressed it.  A good essay for those who haven&#39;t read it - google will take you right to it.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;One can only wonder when divide isn&#39;t ethnic or pregudice based, but anti-government - what will be the response?&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Sic Semper Tyrannis</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8822675477164636185/comments/default/3301382660375939524'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8822675477164636185/comments/default/3301382660375939524'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/set-spin-cycle-to-race-agitate.html?showComment=1235532300000#c3301382660375939524' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/set-spin-cycle-to-race-agitate.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8822675477164636185' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8822675477164636185' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 24, 2009 at 8:25 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9092161364287156308</id><published>2009-02-24T18:09:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-02-24T18:09:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>If this keeps up, Barack Obama could well be the l...</title><content type='html'>If this keeps up, Barack Obama could well be the last president of these united States.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8822675477164636185/comments/default/9092161364287156308'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8822675477164636185/comments/default/9092161364287156308'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/set-spin-cycle-to-race-agitate.html?showComment=1235524140000#c9092161364287156308' title=''/><author><name>Bob</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/16565620274260288512</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='31' height='13' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_DJFdiJYKX2Y/R-VWHCcM2qI/AAAAAAAAATk/Tgw6srrhKx0/S220/TerryToons+02.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/set-spin-cycle-to-race-agitate.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8822675477164636185' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8822675477164636185' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-758129297"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 24, 2009 at 6:09 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4475221697264667902</id><published>2009-02-24T16:54:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-02-24T16:54:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>It would obviously be to the advantage of our rule...</title><content type='html'>&lt;I&gt;It would obviously be to the advantage of our rulers for Americans to think of ourselves as members of ethic collectives that they define for their purposes. The most obvious of those purposes would be simply to keep us divided and inconsolably hostile toward each other.&lt;/I&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;Divide and conquer&quot; has been the ruling kleptoplutocracy&#39;s strategy for at least the last century and a half and it has worked flawlessly.  The only real difference between the Obamunists&#39; strategy and that of their predecessors of a whiter skin shade is their use of race as the divisive accelerant rather than class (although the Obamunists are certainly using this as well).   The sheeple have stepped into the trap every time, without fail, and it is unlikely that the majority will grow functioning brain stems and see through the current ruse either. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Much as I hope I&#39;m wrong, I would counsel everyone in Ameri[k]a to prepare for a redux of Yugoslavia or Ruwanda, although I hope, Will, that you&#39;re right about a peaceful breakup.  That&#39;s our only long-term hope.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8822675477164636185/comments/default/4475221697264667902'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8822675477164636185/comments/default/4475221697264667902'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/set-spin-cycle-to-race-agitate.html?showComment=1235519640000#c4475221697264667902' title=''/><author><name>liberranter</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00555275410576294081</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/set-spin-cycle-to-race-agitate.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8822675477164636185' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8822675477164636185' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-529179912"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 24, 2009 at 4:54 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8456603218908605533</id><published>2009-02-24T15:26:00.000-07:00</published><updated>200